**Public Services Policy Implementation Report**

As of October 2023, the City of Springfield's Department of Public Services (DPS) has initiated the "Green Springfield Initiative" in collaboration with the Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) and the Springfield Urban Planning Agency (SUPA). This initiative focuses on implementing sustainable waste management policies with a target of reducing landfill waste by 30% by 2025. Key stakeholders include Mayor Jane Doe, DPS Director John Smith, and the Springfield City Council.

